hadiths[3]{hadithnumber,text}:
"1494","[AI-translation] Aisha (raziyallahu anha) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Logon ne Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) se kahinon ke baaray mein poocha, to Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne un se farmaya: Wo kuch bhi nahi hain. Unhon ne kaha: Ae Allah ke Rasool! Wo kabhi kabhi aisi baat batatay hain jo sach ho jati hai. To Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Wo haq baat hoti hai jisay jin urr kar le jata hai, phir usay apne dost ke kaan mein murgi ki awaz ki tarah baar baar daalta hai, phir wo us mein sau se zyada jhoot mila detay hain. (Muslim: 7/36). Baab: Chori chupay sun-nay par shaitanon ko sitaron se maaray janay ke baaray mein."
"1495","[AI-translation] Abdullah bin Abbas (raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Mujhe Nabi (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke Sahaba mein se Ansaar mein se aik aadmi ne khabar di ke wo aik raat Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke saath baithay hue thay ke aik sitara toota aur roshni phail gayi, to Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne un se farmaya: Tum zamanay jahiliyat mein jab aisa (sitara) tootta to kya kehtay thay? Unhon ne kaha: Allah aur Us ke Rasool zyada jantay hain, ham kehtay thay ke aaj raat koi bara aadmi paida hua hai aur koi bara aadmi mar gaya hai. To Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Beshak isay (sitara) na kisi ke marnay par phenka jata hai aur na kisi ke jeenay par, lekin hamara Rab, Us ka naam ba-barkat hai, jab kisi baat ka faisla karta hai to Arsh uthanay walay tasbeeh kartay hain, phir un ke qareeb aasman walay tasbeeh kartay hain, yahan tak ke tasbeeh is duniya walay aasman walon tak pahunchti hai, phir Arsh uthanay walon ke qareeb walay Arsh uthanay walon se kehtay hain: Tumharay Rab ne kya kaha? To wo unhein batatay hain ke Unhon ne kya kaha. Unhon ne kaha: Phir aasman walon mein se baaz baaz se khabar poochtay hain, yahan tak ke khabar is duniya walay aasman tak pahunchti hai, to jin (farishton ki baat) sun-nay ko uchak letay hain aur usay apne doston tak pahuncha detay hain aur (us par sitaron se) maaray jatay hain. To jo wo (baat) usi soorat par layein (jaisi suni) to wo haq hai, lekin wo us mein milawat kartay hain aur us mein izafa kartay hain. (Muslim: 7/36-37). Baab: Jo najoomi ke paas aaye to us ki namaz qabool na hogi."
"1496","[AI-translation] Safiyya (Abu Ubaid ki beti) se, Nabi (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ki baaz azwaaj se, Nabi (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) se riwayat hai ke Aap ne farmaya: Jo shakhs kisi najoomi ke paas aaye aur us se kisi cheez ke baaray mein poochay to us ki chalees raaton ki namaz qabool na hogi. (Muslim: 7/37)"
